  "brief": {
    "prose": "Kerwan Floor lies on the smoothed floor of Kerwan, Ceres's oldest great basin, south of the equator: open ground under the Registry, rockier and drier than the Occator workings, the regolith thin over a hard bed that rings under a drill."
  },
